<title>USA: EIF Holdings names Fradella Pres/CEO.</title>
<headline>EIF Holdings names Fradella Pres/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>EIF Holdings Tuesday named Frank Fradella to the post of president and chief executive.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Fradella replaces David Norris, who accepted the position of senior vice president and chief financial officer of American Eco Corp.</p>
<p>Mike McGinnis will remain as chairman of the board of EIF.</p>
<p>Fradella previously was chief operating officer American Eco.</p>
